<div class="vcmessage">
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="row nomargin nopadding" style="margin: 0px !important; text-align: center;">
            <span title="VC Message" class="vcmessagetitle">Vice Chancellor's Message</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row nomargin nopadding vcmessagecontent" style="margin: 0px !important">
            <div class="col-md-3 col-sm-12 center">
                <img class="" src="/images/MainPage/vc-dr.inayat-ullah-khan.png" style="max-width: 100%" alt="Vice Chancellor" title="Vice Chancellor">
                <span title="VC Name" class="vcname">Prof. Dr. Muhammad Inayatullah Khan</span>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-9 col-sm-12">
                <div class="vcmessagetext">
                    <p>
                        A warm and heartfelt welcome to all of you as you embark on an exciting journey at UET, Taxila. &nbsp;As the
                        Vice Chancellor of this esteemed institution, it gives me immense pleasure to greet you all and extend my best wishes
                        for the academic years ahead.
                    </p>
                    <p>&nbsp;</p>
                    <p>
                        Entering the doors of UET, Taxila, you are stepping into an environment dedicated to fostering innovation, creativity,
                        and excellence in engineering education. Our university prides itself on a rich legacy of academic brilliance, coupled with
                        a strong commitment to holistic development.
                    </p>
                    <p>&nbsp;</p>
                    <p>
                        <a href="VCMessage" class="readmore btn btn-primary btn-lg" title="Read more about VC Message">Read more about VC Message</a>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


