                <h4 class="lmb">About UET Taxila</h4>
                <p><span style="color:#0099CC;">With phenomenal increase in students' enrollment in 1970's, a plan to establish additional campuses of the University of Engineering and Technology Lahore was conceived. As a result of that, the University College of Engineering Taxila was established.</span></p>
                <br>
                <a href="AboutUs.aspx" title="About the University">Read more about the University<i class="fa fa-long-arrow-right"></i></a>
            </div>
